00000168                           118  ; NOTE     : THE READ DATA LOOP READS 1 BYTE AT A TIME TO ENSURE ALL FILES CAN
00000168                           119  ;            BE LOADED. HOWEVER, IF THE FILE SIZE IS KNOWN BEFOREHAND, NO LOOP
00000168                           120  ;            WOULD BE NECESSARY AND A SINGLE CALL TO TRAP #15 TASK 53 WOULD 
00000168                           121  ;            READ THE WHOLE FILE AS LONG AS THE FILE SIZE IS PLACED INTO D2.L.
